Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微鎮靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛聯繫過 說馬上就到 都已經5分鐘了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到嗎！小公主還沒到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？到了嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來 小空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}去藍天大地！再遇崇敬的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:23.46,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在走路！小公主在走路！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:30.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救回了小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還深愛小女 照顧小女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真心感謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們保護下來的 不僅僅是小女的人身安全
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是笑容！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:52.44,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 阿翼 真白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是藍天大地的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:03:01.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄也太誇張了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:04.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的... 英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:04.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的... 英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:11.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下！關於綁架小空的壞蛋 我想跟你談談！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 先不要急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等待著公主歸來的 不只是我們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的公主 回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回家 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:37.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國 為什麼要盯上公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事就交給我來處理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就放心回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回父母身邊 好好休養...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.64,0:04:13.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我會用Precure的力量 協助國家！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:14.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:16.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還有我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這會是一場危險的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:23.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管對手有多強 都要貫徹正義直到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:25.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 您平安就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:54.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因我未留守首都 沒能保護好公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 在邊境發生的大火災 還是你萬里馳援
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指揮大局 眾多的人民才得以...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:10.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是本尊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:13.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:15.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,她是颯拉拉隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,守護藍天大地的精英隊伍·藍色護衛隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:25.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,颯拉拉隊長是隊伍的領導 她是世界第一強的劍士！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:29.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！能不能跟我握個手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:30.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:35.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你長大了啊 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那天之後 都已經10年了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:45.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:54.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人就是 小晴崇敬的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很便宜的！買一桶送一杯！（搖鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:13.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻 嘻嘻 嘻嘻 嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:16.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 要涼掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:18.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,現在哪是吃飯的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:21.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下都看好我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:26.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,還說了"你以後就做為騎士 陪伴在公主的身邊"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他說的難道不是叫你“帶小孩”嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:32.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,差...差不多的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:35.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 你真的不要嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.65,0:06:36.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼要求 你們儘管提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,難得陛下一片好心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:48.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真白你卻說“沒什麼想要的”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:52.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空能夠平安回家 就已經足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（搖鈴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶拜託我買一點天空石！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1190,960)}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:06:59.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,跟國王要一點就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:04.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你這樣豈不是 顯得我很臉皮很厚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要扯這些了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道小晴那邊 順不順利？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向隊長敬禮！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來介紹一下實習生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:26.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:29.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,崇敬颯拉拉隊長 以成為英雄為榮！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:34.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我拜託國王陛下 加入到各位之中！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:38.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還遠不成熟 我會竭盡全力的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是個孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別插嘴 莉虹莓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Very Berry （有可愛之意）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼去了別的世界 救了公主什麼的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定是為了加入護衛隊 而捏造的謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:07:59.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有說謊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我反對沒有能力的加入我們 會礙事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:08.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那...那就 測試一下我的能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆 別吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！隊... 隊長？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挑趁手的用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會後悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:50.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那... 那什麼 慰問品... 要買這麼多的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:55.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要的要的！好讓大家好好關照我們家的小晴嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:08:59.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:03.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不分伯仲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:16.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:19.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼了？這是在幹什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.47,0:09:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你們怎麼進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:23.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我們來送慰問的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:24.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還有這些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:28.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:29.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然分神！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色護衛隊是最強的隊伍！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡容不得弱者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勝負已分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:12.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,與強弱無關
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:15.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真正重要的 是要有一顆秉持正義的心...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:18.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我說的沒錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:20.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的心態有問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 你這丫頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:29.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:30.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:32.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:37.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:40.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 都怪我出聲干擾你了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:42.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是我不成熟啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:52.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:54.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我進來了！（開門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我是晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:02.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,正式入隊 請多多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:06.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 好厲害！有英雄的風格了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:09.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們為了藍天大地 一起奮鬥吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要處理的工務堆積如山 就看你了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:17.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:20.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:28.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是想加入藍色護衛隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:30.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才從鄉下來首都的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:36.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然都不知道入隊的流程
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:40.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,剛到首都 就偶然遇到了小空被綁架
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,又偶然地落到了天窗市
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:48.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,再然後 偶然地遇到了真白同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:51.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,偶然大合奏呢 嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:54.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨是這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相逢沒有偶然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:12:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人與人的邂逅 不管在哪個年代 都是必然 都是命運...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是故事的序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是命運...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:16.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為相遇 故事無限擴展開來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:21.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 謝謝你遇到了我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:25.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能夠做永遠的朋友嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:29.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那還用說嗎 小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:37.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真希望這樣的日子能夠長久...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:12:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我先下班了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天很累了吧 你好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於莉虹莓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她小時候 手腕受過重傷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此連續3年 都在入隊測試時被刷了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是她沒有放棄 付出了比別人更多的努力 變得更強...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 她才會那麼執著於強弱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:35.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的心態有問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:39.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我說了很過分的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對現在的莉虹莓來說 算是當頭一棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我會找她談心的 你別放心上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 有件事希望你能記住
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹正義直到最後 這就是英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 你說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而正因如此 英雄更應該時刻思考 究竟何為正義
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:06.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,時刻思考...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓有莉虹莓自己的正義
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每個人都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做英雄 難上加難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:17.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找她！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我要向莉虹莓隊員道歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用 明天我會...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.87,0:14:23.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就太遲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丫頭！不許在走廊奔跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:27.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了一個好孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（開門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:35.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小晴 我們回去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:38.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.59,0:14:40.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？等等我 小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:43.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（腳步聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:50.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是獨自一人 默默努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你是何人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛苦吧？很孤單吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以不用再努力的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:04.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我來為你破壞 這個傷害你的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:08.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:26.27,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:27.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:28.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓隊員！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:31.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,她只是昏過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:35.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我的原則 是不對弱小者出手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:40.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們懂吧 我這麼溫柔的人 是能夠體惜他人的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱小者的悲傷？憤怒？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,諸如此類
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:49.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:52.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,新敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:56.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,正確！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:03.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
