Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:24.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:24.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:33.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
