Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:49.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:49.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
