Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:12.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:15.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
