Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,遼闊拂遠的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:24.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}稜鏡愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高闊凌雲的勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飛翼愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:37.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,準備..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:37.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沖！
