Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:51.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是公主的都城
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:54.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不允許你繼續肆意妄為
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:55.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,真是服了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:59.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過的吧 不對弱小者出手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:02.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然亂暴獸不受此限
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.23,0:18:04.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:08.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓隊員！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:10.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:12.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:17.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:22.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:24.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,看著我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 亂 亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:30.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:33.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:35.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市民們！不要慌張 往那邊避難！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:49.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住... 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:18:59.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:00.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.43,0:19:05.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.95,0:19:13.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 弱小 真是可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:15.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,她才不弱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.23,0:19:25.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓隊員一點都不弱！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:27.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是... 晴雯麗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:34.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你獨自承受著艱辛 一直堅持努力著...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.03,0:19:39.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我對此一無所知 卻大言不慚 說“你的心態有問題"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:44.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:48.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好大的力氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:50.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
