Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡白！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
