Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:46.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？開什麼玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:50.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,佩服佩服！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這一戰 彼此都受益匪淺吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}（新幹部的名字有虛假之意，人如其名吧？）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再戰 虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:15.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓隊員...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就讓她冷靜一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:26.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.31,0:21:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:22:04.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“英雄更應該時刻思考 究竟何為正義”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:09.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,堅強 溫柔 美麗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:10.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我是 Cure Flora！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:10.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1000,960)}百花愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:13.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 貴安！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.38,0:23:48.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好 今天也要去巡邏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.79,0:23:51.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 在護衛隊工作的時候 要小心一點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.62,0:23:52.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:54.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 街上的情況有點怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:56.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那究竟是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:58.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:58.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.16,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,超巨大亂暴獸大爆發!? 守護藍天大地！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.16,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1320,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:44.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:50.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:55.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:01:03.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:08.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:12.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:14.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:18.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:23.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.20,0:01:25.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:29.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:33.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:37.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:37.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:39.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:44.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:49.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:54.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.90,0:01:59.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:02.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.40,0:02:10.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:29.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:34.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:37.09,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:38.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:41.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:44.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.20,0:22:46.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:48.83,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.91,0:22:51.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:53.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.42,0:22:55.96,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.10,0:23:02.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:08.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:10.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:15.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:19.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:25.41,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:29.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:33.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.84,0:23:37.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:38.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.93,0:23:41.64,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
